data: {"id": "1bb018aa10ed4c5e-thinking-parallel_evidence-1099", "run_id": "1bb018aa10ed4c5e", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "所有必要证据已采集完毕。下面是本轮采集到的事实、冲突与缺口总结。\n\n---\n\n## 已采集事实（支持/反驳/限定候选原因）\n\n### 1. Pod 生命周期与状态（kubectl describe + Prometheus）\n- **当前状态**：Pod 为 `Running`，但容器 `app` 处于 `Waiting (CrashLoopBackOff)`，`Ready=False`。\n- **重启次数**：累计 8 次；PromQL range 30 分钟窗口内从 2 → 8，**仍在持续上升**，故障未收敛。\n- **Last State**：`Terminated`，`Exit Code=127`，`Reason=Error`。\n- **Phase 指标**：`kube_pod_status_phase=Running=1`，其余为 0，与 describe 一致。\n- **Waiting Reason 指标**：`CrashLoopBackOff=1`，确认当前仍处在 CrashLoopBackOff 等待中。\n\n### 2. 崩溃前日志（kubectl previous ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1789133029799, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

